+#### options.count
+Type: `Array|String`<br>
+Default: `[]`
+
+A single key (or array of keys) whose value is the number of times the flag was given. Count flags never consume the following argument.
+
+```js
+mri(['-vvv', '--verbose'], { count: 'v', alias: { v: 'verbose' } });
+//=> { _:[], v:4, verbose:4 }
+```
+
 #### options.default
 Type: `Object`<br>
 Default: `{}`
